flowchart TD
  Start["Latch the root"] --> Child["Latch the child"]
  Child --> Safe{"Is the child safe?<br/>insert: not full<br/>delete: more than half full"}
  Safe -->|Yes| Rel["Release every ancestor latch"]
  Safe -->|No| Keep["Keep the ancestor latches:<br/>a split or merge may reach them"]
  Rel --> Leaf{"At the leaf?"}
  Keep --> Leaf
  Leaf -->|No| Child
  Leaf -->|Yes| Op["Do the insert or delete,<br/>then release all latches"]
